[135.546576, "o", "    <div class=\"card\">\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> "]
[135.546728, "o", "      <h3>B.Sc., Computer Science</h3>\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h"]
[135.546824, "o", "> "]
[135.547429, "o", "      <div class=\"meta\">Crestfield College of Engineering, 2008&ndash;2012</div>\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> "]
[135.547678, "o", "      <p>Graduated magna cum laude; President, Data Science Club.</p>\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> "]
[135.547897, "o", "    </div>\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> \r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[135.54807, "o", "\u001b[?2004h>     <h2>Research Interests</h2>\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h>     <ul>\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> "]
[135.548631, "o", "      <li><strong>Neural Encoding &amp; Decoding</strong> &mdash; interpretable models that translate spike&#8209;train data into behavioral predictions.</li> \r\u001bM\u001b[C\u001b[C\u001b[C\u001b[C\u001b[C\u001b[C\u001b[C\u001b[C\u001b[C\u001b[C\u001b[C\u001b[C\u001b[C\u001b[C\u001b[C\u001b[C\u001b[C\u001b[C\u001b[C\u001b[C\u001b[C\u001b[C\u001b[C\u001b[C\u001b[C\u001b[C\u001b[C\u001b[C\u001b[C\u001b[C\u001b[C\u001b[C\u001b[C\u001b[C\u001b[C\u001b[C\u001b[C\u001b[C\u001b[C\u001b[C\u001b[C\u001b[C\u001b[C\u001b[C\u001b[C\u001b[C\u001b[C\u001b[C\u001b[C\u001b[C\u001b[C\u001b[C\u001b[C\u001b[C\u001b[C\u001b[C\u001b[C\u001b[C\u001b[C\u001b[C\u001b[C\u001b[C\u001b[C\u001b[C\u001b[C\u001b[C\u001b[C\u001b[C\u001b[C\u001b[C\u001b[C\u001b[C\u001b[C\u001b[C\u001b[C\u001b[C\u001b[C\u001b[C\u001b[C\u001b[C\u001b[C\u001b[C\u001b[C\u001b[C\u001b[C\u001b[C\u001b[C\u001b[C\u001b[C\u001b[C\u001b[C\u001b[C\u001b[C\u001b[C\u001b[C\u001b[C\u001b[C\u001b[C\u001b[C\u001b[C\u001b[C\u001b[C\u001b[C\u001b[C\u001b[C\u001b[C\u001b[C\u001b[C\u001b[C\u001b[C\u001b[C\u001b[C\u001b[C\u001b[C\u001b[C\u001b[C\u001b[C\u001b[C\u001b[C\u001b[C\u001b[C\u001b[C\u001b[C\u001b[C\u001b[C\u001b[C\u001b[C\u001b[C\u001b[C\u001b[C\u001b[C\u001b[C\u001b[C\u001b[C\u001b[C\u001b[C\u001b[C\u001b[C\u001b[C\u001b[C\u001b[C\u001b[C\u001b[C\u001b[C\u001b[C\u001b[C\u001b[C\u001b[C\u001b[C\u001b[C\u001b[C\u001b[C\u001b[C\u001b[C\u001b[C\u001b[C\u001b[C\u001b[C\u001b[C\u001b[K>\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> "]
[135.548943, "o", "      <li><strong>Machine Learning for Biomedical Imaging</strong> &mdash; CNNs and GNNs applied to MRI and two&#8209;photon microscopy.</li>\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> "]
[135.54947, "o", "      <li><strong>Single&#8209;Cell Omics</strong> &mdash; scalable pipelines integrating multi&#8209;modal single&#8209;cell genomics and spatial transcriptomics.</li>\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> "]
[135.549883, "o", "      <li><strong>Explainable AI in Neuroscience</strong> &mdash; probing decision boundaries and feature attributions in black&#8209;box models.</li>\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> "]
[135.550053, "o", "    </ul>\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> \r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> "]
[135.550227, "o", "    <h2>Selected Projects</h2>\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h>     <div class=\"card\">\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> "]
[135.55043, "o", "      <span class=\"project-role\">Lead Developer &amp; Project Coordinator</span>\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> "]
[135.550946, "o", "      <h3>DeepVision: High&#8209;Resolution Neural Activity Mapping</h3>\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h>       <ul>\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> "]
[135.551562, "o", "        <li>Designed a PyTorch&#8209;based pipeline to segment two&#8209;photon images of mouse visual cortex.</li>\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h>         <li>Integrated temporal convolutional networks to predict stimulus orientation from calcium&#8209;imaging traces.</li>\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> "]
[135.551809, "o", "        <li>Deployed a Dockerized microservice with Cascade Imaging Lab.</li>\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h>       </ul>\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h"]
[135.552598, "o", ">     </div>\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h>     <div class=\"card\">\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h>       <span class=\"project-role\">Principal Investigator</span>\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h>       <h3>NeuroGraph: Graph Neural Networks for Circuit Analysis</h3>\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h>       <ul>\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> "]
[135.552894, "o", "        <li>Constructed graph representations of reconstructed neuron meshes from electron&#8209;microscopy.</li>\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> "]
[135.553898, "o", "        <li>Trained GNNs to classify synapse types and infer connectivity motifs.</li>\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h>         <li>Published an open&#8209;source toolkit adopted by 12 labs worldwide.</li>\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h>       </ul>\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h>     </div>\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h>     <div class=\"card\">\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h>       <span class=\"project-role\">Co&#8209;Principal Investigator</span>\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> "]
[135.55421, "o", "      <h3>CellMap: Multi&#8209;Modal Single&#8209;Cell Atlas</h3>\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h>       <ul>\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> "]
[135.554765, "o", "        <li>Developed a Nextflow workflow combining scRNA&#8209;Seq, ATAC&#8209;Seq, and spatial FISH data.</li>\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> "]
[135.55605, "o", "        <li>Implemented Bayesian clustering to resolve cell&#8209;type hierarchies in human cortical organoids.</li>\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h>         <li>Presented at ICSCG 2023.</li>\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h>       </ul>\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h>     </div>\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> \r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h>     <h2>Skills &amp; Tools</h2>\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h>     <ul>\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h>       <li><strong>Languages:</strong> Python, R, C++</li>\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> "]
[135.556221, "o", "      <li><strong>Frameworks:</strong> PyTorch, TensorFlow, scikit&#8209;learn, NetworkX</li>\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> "]
[135.556484, "o", "      <li><strong>Data Tools:</strong> Nextflow, Snakemake, Docker, Kubernetes</li>\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> "]
[135.55666, "o", "      <li><strong>Analysis:</strong> MATLAB, Jupyter, Seurat, Scanpy</li>\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h"]
[135.556761, "o", "> "]
[135.556904, "o", "      <li><strong>Visualization:</strong> D3.js, Plotly, Matplotlib</li>\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> "]
[135.55698, "o", "    </ul>\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[135.55701, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> \r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[135.557074, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> "]
